  "body_html": "<h1>exists_invariant_distribution</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem exists_invariant_distribution (A : I → I → ℝ) (hA : IsStochasticMatrix A) : ∃ x : stdSimplex ℝ I, ∀ j, ∑ i, x.val i * A i j = x.val j</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>optimalRowStrategies</li>\n<li>optimalColumnStrategies</li>\n<li>exists_mixed_nash_equilibrium</li>\n<li>optimal_pairs_iff_saddle_point</li>\n<li>mem_optimalRowStrategies_iff_E_ge</li>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure</li>\n<li>Lottery.pure</li>\n<li>wsum_pure_apply</li>\n<li>total_mass_preserved</li>\n</ul>",
